# 中频词汇 List07
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List07核心词汇

{{deposit}}{/dɪˈpɒzɪt/}{存款；沉积物；押金}{You need to pay a deposit when renting an apartment.}}
{{depress}}{/dɪˈpres/}{使沮丧；压下}{The economic downturn depressed consumer spending.}}
{{deprive}}{/dɪˈpraɪv/}{剥夺；使丧失}{The war deprived children of their right to education.}}
{{derive}}{/dɪˈraɪv/}{源自；获得}{Many English words derive from Latin and Greek.}}
{{deserve}}{/dɪˈzɜːv/}{值得；应得}{The team deserves recognition for their hard work.}}
{{design}}{/dɪˈzaɪn/}{设计；构思}{The architect designed an eco-friendly building.}}
{{desire}}{/dɪˈzaɪər/}{渴望；欲望}{The desire for knowledge drives scientific research.}}
{{despite}}{/dɪˈspaɪt/}{尽管；不管}{Despite the rain, the event was a great success.}}
{{detect}}{/dɪˈtekt/}{发现；探测}{The sensor can detect changes in temperature.}}
{{determine}}{/dɪˈtɜːmɪn/}{决定；确定}{Your attitude determines your success in life.}}
{{device}}{/dɪˈvaɪs/}{装置；设备；策略}{The device measures air quality in real time.}}
{{devote}}{/dɪˈvəʊt/}{奉献；致力于}{She devoted her career to medical research.}}
{{dimension}}{/daɪˈmenʃn/}{维度；方面}{The problem has both economic and social dimensions.}}
{{diminish}}{/dɪˈmɪnɪʃ/}{减少；缩小}{The influence of traditional media has diminished.}}
{{diplomatic}}{/ˌdɪpləˈmætɪk/}{外交的；老练的}{Diplomatic relations between the two countries improved.}}
{{discipline}}{/ˈdɪsɪplɪn/}{纪律；学科}{Success requires discipline and hard work.}}
{{disclose}}{/dɪsˈkləʊz/}{揭露；公开}{The company refused to disclose financial information.}}
{{discount}}{/ˈdɪskaʊnt/}{折扣；打折}{The store offers a 20% discount on all items.}}
{{discriminate}}{/dɪˈskrɪmɪneɪt/}{歧视；区分}{It is illegal to discriminate against people based on race.}}
{{disorder}}{/dɪsˈɔːdər/}{混乱；疾病}{Anxiety is a common mental health disorder.}}
{{display}}{/dɪˈspleɪ/}{展示；显示}{The museum displays artifacts from the Roman era.}}
{{dispose}}{/dɪˈspəʊz/}{处理；处置}{Chemical waste must be disposed of properly.}}
{{distinct}}{/dɪˈstɪŋkt/}{不同的；明显的}{The two species are quite distinct from each other.}}
{{distinguish}}{/dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ/}{区分；辨别}{It is hard to distinguish between the two products.}}
{{distribute}}{/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/}{分配；分发}{The charity distributes food to those in need.}}
{{diverse}}{/daɪˈvɜːs/}{多样的；不同的}{The university has a diverse student body.}}
{{document}}{/ˈdɒkjumənt/}{文件；记录}{Please keep all relevant documents for the audit.}}
{{domestic}}{/dəˈmestɪk/}{国内的；家庭的}{Domestic flights are usually cheaper than international ones.}}
{{dominant}}{/ˈdɒmɪnənt/}{占主导地位的；支配的}{English is the dominant language in international business.}}
{{donate}}{/dəʊˈneɪt/}{捐赠；捐献}{Many people donate to charity during the holiday season.}}
